{"3935180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bound by Valor", "steam_appid": 3935180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Select your hero and face relentless hordes of enemies in Bound by Valor, a fast-paced co-op action roguelike focused on wave-based combat, evolving builds, and powerful elemental synergies. Every run lets you forge a new build through evolving abilities, elemental synergies, and team-based combos… solo or with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/766fb6522f0d41edb3c0baf2030f89e0.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/766fb6522f0d41edb3c0baf2030f89e0.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/766fb6522f0d41edb3c0baf2030f89e0.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/ffe6d80b59c0a380c336effe23e3ca9e.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/ffe6d80b59c0a380c336effe23e3ca9e.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/ffe6d80b59c0a380c336effe23e3ca9e.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the elements to unleash devastating effects. Chain abilities with your allies to amplify damage through fire, poison, ice, electricity, and magic. Different elemental combinations produce unique outcomes — smart timing and teamwork can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/9b87f7ca565f76cfe71d984bbb34fb24.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/9b87f7ca565f76cfe71d984bbb34fb24.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/9b87f7ca565f76cfe71d984bbb34fb24.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/99b8f14f1856f410b379fb4c237457e4.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/99b8f14f1856f410b379fb4c237457e4.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/99b8f14f1856f410b379fb4c237457e4.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo to prove your mastery, or team up with up to three friends to defend the Flower of Life together. Each mode offers unique challenges and strategies — coordination and positioning are key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/d69d46cd7c96c862d4a096bc11d91829.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/d69d46cd7c96c862d4a096bc11d91829.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/d69d46cd7c96c862d4a096bc11d91829.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/038ed346cfd8da157bf7d2a2030a4f54.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/038ed346cfd8da157bf7d2a2030a4f54.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/038ed346cfd8da157bf7d2a2030a4f54.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a core ability and watch your arsenal evolve as the game progresses. Choose from plenty of unique abilities and create a new loadout for each round! Whether you’re in the mood for ranged abilities, defenses, or magic abilities, you can tailor your loadout to your liking and receive awesome buffs for pairing up the right abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/26e57636d706fec2722ff08337099a8a.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/26e57636d706fec2722ff08337099a8a.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/26e57636d706fec2722ff08337099a8a.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through varied enemy factions, each with their own behaviors and threats — from bombers and ranged attackers to heavily armored units. Survive the waves to face powerful bosses designed to test your builds, reflexes, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/96fdc8266e824dbf6181683c71067dfb.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/96fdc8266e824dbf6181683c71067dfb.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/96fdc8266e824dbf6181683c71067dfb.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/f4eb590153389a466505b2bf6f823523.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/f4eb590153389a466505b2bf6f823523.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/f4eb590153389a466505b2bf6f823523.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet an eclectic cast of heroes, each with a unique playstyle, hero buff, and backstory. Ride your pet snail into battle as Bloomy, obliterate enemies with B.E.A.M.’s cyborg powers, splash through hordes with Wellito, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/31d95ee7e1b98c2fa1d9ae47ad1d4f34.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1000 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/31d95ee7e1b98c2fa1d9ae47ad1d4f34.webm?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/31d95ee7e1b98c2fa1d9ae47ad1d4f34.mp4?t=1784316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 Player Cooperative Wave-Based Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Ability Customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Elemental Synergies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct, Memorable Heroes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemies &amp; Epic Bosses</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Select your hero and face relentless hordes of enemies in Bound by Valor, a fast-paced co-op action roguelike focused on wave-based combat, evolving builds, and powerful elemental synergies. Every run lets you forge a new build through evolving abilities, elemental synergies, and team-based combos… solo or with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/766fb6522f0d41edb3c0baf2030f89e0.poster.avif?t=1784316129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935180/extras/766fb6522f0d41edb3c0baf2030f89